EGEN,3,5,1,4
THICK,1,16,1,1.5
* groups 2-5: storey-1 walls South (y = -6), East (x = 6), North (y = 6), West (x = -6); 4 x 2 shells each
GROUP,2,SHELL
GTIT,2,panel 1: storey 1 south wall
MACT,11
E,1,1,2,27,26
