EGEN,1,25,1,4
GROUP,3,SHELL
GTIT,3,panel 2: storey 1 east wall
MACT,12
E,1,5,10,35,30
EGEN,3,5,1
EGEN,1,25,1,4
GROUP,4,SHELL
GTIT,4,panel 3: storey 1 north wall
MACT,13
E,1,21,22,47,46
EGEN,3,1,1
